# �T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T
# BOS Pipeline v9.0 �� Environment Variables
# �T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T
# Copy this file to .env and adjust values.

# ���� Application ����
APP_NAME=BOS Pipeline
APP_VERSION=9.0.0
ENVIRONMENT=development
DEBUG=true
SECRET_KEY=change-me-to-a-random-64-char-string-in-production
ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1

# ���� Database (PostgreSQL) ����
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://bos:bos_secret@db:5432/bos_pipeline
DATABASE_URL_SYNC=postgresql://bos:bos_secret@db:5432/bos_pipeline
POSTGRES_USER=bos
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=bos_secret
POSTGRES_DB=bos_pipeline

# ���� Redis ����
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://redis:6379/1
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://redis:6379/2

# ���� JWT Authentication ����
JWT_SECRET_KEY=change-me-jwt-secret-key-at-least-32-chars
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# ���� CORS ����
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:8080

# ���� Rate Limiting ����
RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=60
RATE_LIMIT_BURST=10

# ���� Stripe Billing ����
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_STARTER=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_PROFESSIONAL=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_ENTERPRISE=price_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ���� Email (SMTP) ����
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=noreply@bos-pipeline.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=change-me
SMTP_FROM=BOS Pipeline <noreply@bos-pipeline.com>

# ���� Sentry Error Tracking ����
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=development
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
VITE_APP_VERSION=9.0.0

# ���� OpenTelemetry ����
OTEL_ENABLED=false
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4317
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=bos-pipeline-backend
OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER=parentbased_traceidratio
OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG=0.2
OTEL_CONSOLE_EXPORT=false
OTEL_ENVIRONMENT=development

# ���� Feature Flags ����
FF_ENABLE_MONTE_CARLO=true
FF_ENABLE_DIGITAL_TWIN=true
FF_ENABLE_AUTOML=false
FF_ENABLE_WEBSOCKET=true
FF_ENABLE_EXPORT_PARQUET=true
FF_ENABLE_BILLING=true
FF_ENABLE_MULTI_LANGUAGE=true
FF_ENABLE_DARK_MODE=true

# ���� Frontend (Vite) ����
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
VITE_WS_BASE_URL=ws://localhost:8000/ws
